          01 · Type Scale
        </span>
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px flex-1 bg-sand-7"></span>
      </div>

      <p class="mb-14 max-w-[60ch] text-body text-sand-11">
        Nine steps on a <strong class="font-semibold text-sand-12"
          >Perfect Fourth</strong
